            equals: "yes",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("I’m glad we agree, Li’sar. Now, onward! We must reach the cave."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_22",
        on: "branch_if_22",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "waterfall_sighted",
            not_equals: "yes",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("I’m glad we agree, Li’sar. Now, onward! We must continue downstream, past these drakes."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_20",
        on: "moveto",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter",
            side: 1,
          },
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:config_side",
            side: 4,
            share_vision: "all",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("I see someone at the top of the furthermost cliff!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:lift_fog",
            side: 1,
            cells: "44,15",
            radius: 2,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scroll_to",
            x: 44,
            y: 15,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("It is a young human officer, barely more than a boy. He appears badly hurt but still alive."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("I wonder why the drakes haven’t finished him by now? It is strange that there are not any drakes in that area."),
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_2",
            type: "Water Serpent",
            side: 3,
            x: 47,
            y: 12,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "u_2",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_3",
            type: "Water Serpent",
            side: 3,
            x: 44,
            y: 11,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "u_3",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_4",
            type: "Water Serpent",
            side: 3,
            x: 49,
            y: 15,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "u_4",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_5",
            type: "Water Serpent",
            side: 3,
            x: 47,
            y: 17,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "u_5",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_6",
            type: "Water Serpent",
            side: 3,
            x: 44,
            y: 18,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "u_6",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Grrroar"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scroll_to_unit",
            id: "unit",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Well... that answers the question."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Li'sar",
            text: _("We should try to help the injured soldier."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("Must I remind you that he, like all the others who died, was sent to kill us!?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Li'sar",
            text: _("Perhaps he was sent after you, but not after me. I am sure that he is still loyal to his princess — the heiress to the throne of Wesnoth!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("Li’sar, do I have to remind you again that it is Konrad, not you, who is the rightful heir?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Li'sar",
            text: _("Be that as it may, I still think we should make an effort to rescue him from the unfortunate position he is in. If you help him, I’ll do my best to convince him that you are not his enemies but his friends."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kalenz",
            text: _("Very well. If you convince him not to raise his sword against us, the Lintanir elves shall grant him safe passage."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("Our main goal remains to survive ourselves, but if we can spare the troops, we might try to rescue the officer stranded on the cliff. However, I make no promises."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Li'sar",
            text: _("That I do understand, Konrad. I am no stranger to the burden of command."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_21",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_22",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "lieutenant_sighted",
            value: "yes",
            mode: "value",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:show_objectives",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_23",
        on: "moveto",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter",
            side: 1,
            x: "43,43,44,44,45,45",
            y: "14,15,14,16,14,15",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:kill_unit",
            unit: "Warven",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Warven",
            type: "Lieutenant",
            side: 1,
            x: 44,
            y: 15,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Warven",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:make_loyal",
            unit: "Warven",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Warven",
            text: _("Who...who are you? A friend or a foe?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("We are friends. Don’t worry about it and don’t try to fight us — you are in no condition to fight."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Li'sar",
            text: _("I am the Princess, Li’sar, and we are friends. Join us and wait for the healers to help you, young lieutenant."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Warven",
            text: _("Princess Li’sar — here? Your Highness, I am yours to command!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("Follow us when you think you are capable and beware of monsters. We have fought many already, and there are sure to be more ahead."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "lieutenant_sighted",
            value: "no",
            mode: "value",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_25",
        on: "moveto",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter",
            x: 36,
            y: 0,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("I’ve reached the cave entrance. There seems to be a system of channels running through the mountains. Follow me, and let us hope we somehow manage to get out alive."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Li'sar",
            text: _("That is so very encouraging..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("I wonder what kind of monsters await us inside."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kalenz",
            text: _("We are soon going to find out."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Li'sar",
            text: _("Well, there is no point in delaying any further. Let us go and find out."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Warven",
            text: _("Yes, my lady!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("Everybody inside..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "win",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_24",
        on: "moveto",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter",
            side: 1,
            x: 54,
            y: 2,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "waterfall_sighted",
            value: "yes",
            mode: "value",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("There is a cataract ahead. By the thunder of the water and the height of the spume, it must drop several hundred feet at least. We must leave the river before we are swept into it, or we will surely perish!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:remove_item",
            x: 55,
            y: 3,
            item_name: "",
            image: "",
