          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:add_item",
            x: 55,
            y: 3,
            item_name: "",
            image: "halo%2Felven%2Fnature-halo1.png",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "merman-advisor",
            text: _("Even we merfolk cannot swim that. The road east is blocked."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("Wait. What about the tributary which flows into the river from inside the mountain? There seems to be a cave..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kalenz",
            text: _("Legend says that that little river comes from the land of the North Elves. It is said that it is an outflow of Everlore, which flows in the land of my home and that there is a cave system in that area with several cave entrances and springs which flow into the ground. I can say no more about it, except that it is swarming with undead and other creatures which find power in the darkness of the caves. We elves prefer not to venture into the caves; instead we put guards near the entrances to kill any foul creature foolish enough to wander outside. No elves have been inside for centuries and that area is unknown to us. Truly, I don’t recommend entering the cave if we have any other options."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("Unfortunately, we have no other options. Onward into the cave!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:show_objectives",
          },
